{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并行法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "丁以反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "〔印用霹靂棗木方一寸七分，\n用朱砂印毒兼印紙上，與患\n者吞之，治一切病大驗。〕"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "〔印用白檀木一寸三分，同前\n印紙并印毒□及吞。〕"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "食食食食"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "花樹花樹"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "〔朱書吞之治□□〕"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "〔用朱書紙上封了帶之、除諸鬼氣〕"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": "0294005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0294005", "type": "orig", "text": "【原】仁平二年寫石山寺藏本"}
{"id": null, "n": "0295001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0295001", "type": "orig", "text": "以下缺字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0295a2101", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0295a2101", "type": "add", "text": "歡【CB】，觀【大】"}
